# Boot Interceptor Project Rules

## 🎯 Project Overview
SaaS bot interception and redirection system with React frontend and Python Flask backend. Specializes in detecting bots and redirecting them to credit pages for crawling, enabling monetization through bot traffic. Features multi-tenant architecture, subscription management, billing integration, and advanced bot detection algorithms.

## 📁 File Structure
```
boot-interceptor/
├── frontend/          # React SaaS application
├── backend/           # Flask API with multi-tenant support
├── database/          # Database schemas & migrations
├── billing/           # Billing and subscription management
├── credit-pages/      # Credit page templates and logic
├── nginx/            # Nginx configuration
└── docs/             # Documentation
```

